{
  "$schema": "https://o2csi.github.io/candeo/device-definition.schema.json",
  "name": "Razer BlackWidow V4 Tenkeyless HyperSpeed (wireless)",
  "notes": [
    "Unverified: never tried on the device. Derived on 2026-09-27 from razer-deathstalker-v2-pro.json, verified on firmware v1.5, by derive.mjs.",
    "What differs: product id 02d5, interface 2, transaction byte 9f, a 6×18 matrix (HyperSpeed wireless dongle).",
    "From OpenRGB, https://gitlab.com/CalcProgrammer1/OpenRGB, commit 0f8f2dcc (2026-09-25): Controllers/RazerController, for each model's matrix, read by openrgb.mjs, its interface and its transaction byte.",
    "From OpenRazer, https://github.com/openrazer/openrazer, commit 6820f9da (2026-07-05): driver/razerkbd_driver.c and daemon/openrazer_daemon/hardware/keyboards.py, for the same facts as seen from Linux.",
    "Drawn as an ISO board: on an ANSI one, the key left of Z is absent and the backslash lights with Enter. Lights that are not keys are placed by convention.",
    "The inspection is left out until someone confirms the device answers it.",
    "Does it light? Say so: https://github.com/o2csi/candeo/issues/new?template=device-report.yml"
  ],
  "match": { "vid": "1532", "pid": "02d5", "interface": 2 },
  "report": {
    "wire": "feature",
    "length": 90,
    "prefix": "00",
    "checksum": { "function": "xor", "from": 2, "to": 87, "at": 88 },
    "command": { "class": 6, "id": 7 }
  },
  "frame": {
    "each": {
      "by": "row",
      "send": ["00 9f 00 00 00 {length:8} 0f 03 00 00 {row} {start} {end} {lights}"],
      "light": "{r} {g} {b}"
    },
    "close": ["00 9f 00 00 00 06 0f 02 00 00 08 00 00 00"]
  },
  "brightness": ["00 9f 00 00 00 03 0f 04 00 00 {level}"],
  "firmware": {
    "send": "00 9f 00 00 00 06 0f 02 00 00 {kind} 00 00 00",
    "off": "00",
    "effects": [
      {
        "id": "hardware:spectrumCycle",
        "kind": "03",
        "looks": "spectrum",
        "name": "Spectrum Cycle",
        "summary": {
          "en": "The whole keyboard changes hue together, endlessly.",
          "fr": "Tout le clavier change de teinte ensemble, sans fin."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "hardware:wave",
        "kind": "04",
        "looks": "wave",
        "send": "00 9f 00 00 00 06 0f 02 00 00 04 02 28 00",
        "name": "Wave",
        "summary": {
          "en": "A gradient crosses the keyboard from side to side.",
          "fr": "Un dégradé traverse le clavier de part en part."
        }
      }
    ]
  },
